  "prefLabel": "Lot 7207.08 Payments to Patrons",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7207.08 Payments to Patrons.\n\n(a) Each GOE shall pay all prizes, payouts, tickets, and vouchers due to a patron upon presentation or request by the player during regular business hours, provided that the player supplies satisfactory documentation and forms in accordance with the GOE’s house rules and game and promotional procedures.\n\n(b) Winning wagers shall be processed according to U.S. Internal Revenue Service reporting requirements for the purposes of taxation.\n\nSource. #14503, eff 2-4-26, EXPIRES: 2-4-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot7200.html"
}
